  <XDFHEADER>
    <flags>0x1</flags>
    <description>Combined display XDF for BMW B58 / MG1CS003, EPK R0C2J772B, EPST R0C9J772B, PST S15A-17-11-490, HW 10SW002828.
Merges 75 inspection tables with 10 ignition-timing tables into one file. Load against the matching 8126464-byte BIN. Do not write to the ECU.
Ignition section: map names, dimensions and the x0.5 deg conversion come from the Bosch A2L R0C9J8B2B_3081-080_017_002.a2l, which describes S15A-18. This target is S15A-17, so identity, signedness, scaling, units and axis semantics are INHERITED, not proven for this image. Addresses and byte spans were verified against the target binary itself.
Three raw [UNVERIFIED] windows from the inspection set are omitted (70318B, 7032CB, 70340B): their bytes are now identified as KF_ZW_S_PF1, KF_ZW_PF2 and KF_ZW_PF1, and are shown with real axes in the ignition section instead.
Exploratory display only. Not a validated tuning definition.</description>
    <BASEOFFSET offset="0" subtract="0"/>
    <DEFAULTS datasizeinbits="16" sigdigits="3" outputtype="1" signed="0" lsbfirst="0" float="0"/>
    <REGION type="0xFFFFFFFF" startaddress="0x0" size="0x7c0000" regioncolor="0x0" regionflags="0x0" name="Binary File" desc="bin edited by this XDF"/>
